  "summary": "`env-test-guard` was removed from crates.io for malicious code",
  "details": "`env-test-guard` attempted to exfiltrate credentials from the environment to an\narbitrary URL.\n\nThe malicious crate had 2 versions published on 2026-03-24 and 2026-03-25,\napproximately 8 months before removal, and had no evidence of actual usage.\nThis crate had no dependencies on crates.io.\n\nThanks to [Bitbison](https://bitbison.io/) for the report.",
